## 🔐 Authentication

**Type**: <!auth.type>
**Required**: <!auth.required bool>

<?auth.type eq "bearer">
### Bearer Token Authentication
Include your API key in the Authorization header:

```http
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY
```

**Get your API key**: [Developer Dashboard](<!auth.dashboard_url>)
</auth.type>

<?auth.type eq "oauth2">
### OAuth 2.0 Authentication
**Flow**: <!auth.oauth_flow>
**Scopes**: <!auth.scopes>

**Authorization URL**: `<!auth.auth_url>`
**Token URL**: `<!auth.token_url>`

#### Required Scopes:
<?auth.scope_count int>
<!auth.scope_list>
</auth.scope_count>
</auth.type>

<?auth.type eq "apikey">
### API Key Authentication
**Header**: `<!auth.header_name>`
**Query Parameter**: `<!auth.query_param>` (alternative)

```http
<!auth.header_name>: YOUR_API_KEY
```
</auth.type>

<?auth.rate_limits bool>
## 📊 Rate Limits

**Standard Tier**: <!rate_limits.standard_requests int> requests/<!rate_limits.standard_window>
**Premium Tier**: <!rate_limits.premium_requests int> requests/<!rate_limits.premium_window>

**Rate Limit Headers**:
- `X-RateLimit-Limit`: Total requests allowed
- `X-RateLimit-Remaining`: Requests remaining
- `X-RateLimit-Reset`: Time when limit resets

<?rate_limits.has_burst bool>
**Burst Allowance**: <!rate_limits.burst_requests int> requests in <!rate_limits.burst_window> seconds
</rate_limits.has_burst>
</auth.rate_limits>

